.SH BUGS
The window, the clip and the position baseline come from a measurement with Qwen3-0.6B over the
tree's docs, man pages and C
.RB ( doc/words.md );
.IR Crux 's
relative scale, 1.5 times the spread with a least spread of 0.1 bits a rune, is set by eye on
.IR lmsim 's
model of bytes, not on the real model.
.PP
.I Crux
knows dot, not the lines the text window shows, so while the reader scrolls the text window and
dot stays behind, the strip stays behind too, until the next click.
.PP
.I Crux
finds the window it turns off by its label, so two text windows on one file share one.

